BizPal is a social communication tool for foreign trade business. It serves international traders as well as export and import businesses under THE MODE of B2B and B2C. It is the "business partner" of buyers, sellers and international trade service providers.
Here gathered a large number of high-quality global suppliers, buyers and service providers. You can talk business with businessmen directly, and use business contacts to enhance mutual trust, get rid of the traditional "search - inquiry" cold start mode.

BizPal features ：
[Match the business partners] Big data helps achieve the most accurate requirements matching and partner recommendation;
[Video dynamic] Full display of corporate image, unlock new forms of corporate promotion;
[Trading market] Easy release of commodity information or procurement needs, your foreign trade good helper;
[Multilingual meeting] Multilingual meetings, real-time translations in 10 languages, and minutes can be saved automatically;
[Service resources] Foreign trade service station all package, reduce cost, improve efficiency;
[Customs data] Free access to customs information to find new business opportunities.

What can BizPal do for you?
1.BizPal application for "Daily Business Networking"
-Accurate matching of business friends, online automatic mining customers;
-Easily publish product information or purchase demand anytime and anywhere.
2.BizPal application in "Digital Overseas Sample Room"
-Without going abroad, we can cultivate the target market for a long time;
-Buyers experience samples in their home countries and talk about cross-border business online.
3.Application of BizPal in "Cross-country Online Matchmaking"
-Accurate one-to-one docking between buyers and sellers saves time and effort;
-Real-time translation of multilingual meetings, barrier-free international communication.

To talk with customers and do business, use a BizPal system!
